  "fullText": "Now offering an off-site tuning session at cost to three selected teams in 2026. Apply Here\n\nSkip to Content\nOpen Menu\nBehind every problem is a pattern waiting to be understood.\nInsight That Leads to Aligned Action\n\nWe help you uncover the patterns behind confusion or misalignment so your next steps are clear, timely, and resonant.\n\nHow We Work\n\nWe partner with founders, individuals, and teams navigating growth, tension, and transition.\n\nOur work supports both personal development and team coherence—building leaders who stay present under pressure and teams that stay connected under strain.\n\nBy aligning individual insight with collective action, we help you turn isolated excellence into coordinated intelligence that moves the whole system forward.\n\nSERVICES\nTHE CORE\nOFFERING\n\nCore is our embedded coaching and consulting model designed to strengthen your entire organization, not just individual leaders.\n\nMost coaching supports personal growth. Core connects it to performance, team alignment, and culture change, where the real leverage lives.\n \n\nWe help you:\n\nDevelop leaders who stay present and effective under pressure\n\nBuild teams that work together, not just side by side\n\nShift culture in real time, based on what’s actually happening inside the system\n\nCreate aligned, creative solutions to complex challenges\n\nMove from reactive patterns to intentional, inspired action\n\nCore doesn’t just grow people. It transforms how your company works.\n\nBook a consultation to get a plan customized for your team.\n\nLet's Chat\nCORE tEAM\n\nWith Core, you don’t just get a single coach—you get a coordinated team, attuned to each other and to your organization.\n\nThe Core Team operates as a system within your system.\n\nWe embed inside your company to surface what’s working, unlock what’s stuck, and support your leaders and teams to move forward with clearer decisions, stronger collaboration, and a culture that can hold growth without breaking.\n\nMeet the Team\nTogetherness that works\n\nWe facilitate the growth of individuals and groups to create high-functioning teams.\n\nGet Started\nNewsletter + Podcast\n\nWomens Retreat\n\nStories, insights, and new ideas from Heartwood. Get our monthly Newsletter, new podcast episodes and more by subsribing to Heartwood Collective on Substack. \n\nEvents\n\nVC Retreat\n\nFollow\n\nLinkedIn\n\nGet in touch\n\nhello@thehwc.com\n\nSubstack\n\nYoutube\n\nSelf-Transforming Teams\n\nHome\n\nThe Team\n\nFor Companies\n\nFor Investors\n\nTO TOP\n\nWe Respect your Privacy - Privacy Policy  | Data Processing Policy\n2025 Heartwood Collective, a part of Project Atlas LLC.\nCookie Preferences"
